## Common Use Cases

### Code Review Agent

Delegated when code changes are detected or the user requests a review.

### Security Audit Agent

Delegated when the user asks about security, vulnerabilities, or when reviewing third-party dependencies.

### Documentation Agent

Delegated when code lacks comments, functions need API docs, or README files need updates.

### Performance Agent

Delegated when slow code is identified, profiling is needed, or optimization suggestions are requested.

### Data Analysis Agent

Delegated for SQL queries, database schema exploration, data visualization, or statistical analysis.

